iew** to **View** menu that instantiates a `Camera3D` node using the current editor viewport's transform, field of view, near and far settings.\r\n\r\n### What it does?\r\n- Creates a new `Camera3D` node based on the editor camera\r\n- Preserves transform, FOV and near/far clipping planes\r\n- Adds the camera to the scene tree with undo/redo support\r\n- Automatically selects the new camera in the editor\r\n\r\n### Motivation\r\nThis complements the existing **Align Transform with View** action by providing a faster, more complete workflow for camera creation. It is especially useful for level design, cinematics and scene layout.\r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/834ca43c-1cb7-444a-bada-d9cba58672e9","labels":[{"id":73330066,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2Ng==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/enhancement","name":"enhancement","description":"","color":"aaccff","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279096997,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTY5OTc=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/archived","name":"archived","description":"","color":"aaaaaa","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098219,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgyMTk=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:editor","name":"topic:editor","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":2666708289,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNjY2NzA4Mjg5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:3d","name":"topic:3d","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"created_at":"2025-09-20T01:32:59Z","updated_at":"2026-02-07T12:37:43Z","closed_at":"2025-09-23T15:20:33Z","merged_at":null,"merge_commit_sha":"3dd3e37ea6b0b8db69c3d91ee2046d611b1871c2","assignee":null,"assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"head":{"label":"The